#: crypto.cpp:106
msgid "%1 (%2 of %3 bits)"
msgstr "%1 (%2 o %3 did)"

#: crypto.cpp:254
msgid "Enable &TLS support if supported by the server"
msgstr "Galluogi cynhaliaeth &TLS os yw'r gweinydd yn ei gynnal."

#: crypto.cpp:257
msgid ""
"TLS is the newest revision of the SSL protocol. It integrates better with "
"other protocols and has replaced SSL in protocols such as POP3 and SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Addasiad diweddaraf y protocol SLL yw TLS. Mae'n cyfuno'n well â "
"phrotocolau eraill, ac mae wedi amnewid SSL mewn protocolau megis POP3 ac "
"SMTP."

#: crypto.cpp:262
msgid "Enable SSLv&2"
msgstr "Galluogi SSLf&2"

#: crypto.cpp:265
msgid ""
"SSL v2 is the second revision of the SSL protocol. It is most common to "
"enable v2 and v3."
msgstr "Ail addasiad y protocol SSL yw SSL f2. Mae'n gyffredin i alluogi f2 ac f3."

#: crypto.cpp:269
msgid "Enable SSLv&3"
msgstr "Galluogi SSLf&3"

#: crypto.cpp:272
msgid ""
"SSL v3 is the third revision of the SSL protocol. It is most common to "
"enable v2 and v3."
msgstr ""
"Trydydd addasiad y protocol SSL yw SSL f3. Mae'n gyffredin i alluogi f2 ac "
"f3."

#: crypto.cpp:278
msgid "SSLv2 Ciphers to Use"
msgstr "Dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu SSLf2 i'w Defnyddio"

#: crypto.cpp:279
msgid ""
"Select the ciphers you wish to enable when using the SSL v2 protocol. The "
"actual protocol used will be negotiated with the server at connection time."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu yr hoffech eu galluogi pan yn defnyddio'r "
"protocol SSL f2. Trafodir y protocol i'w ddefnyddio ei hun â'r gweinydd ar "
"adeg cysylltu."

#: crypto.cpp:289
msgid ""
"SSL ciphers cannot be configured because this module was not linked with "
"OpenSSL."
msgstr ""
"Ni ellir ffurfweddu dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu SSL oherwydd ni gysylltwyd y "
"modiwl yma âg OpenSSL."

#: crypto.cpp:304
msgid "SSLv3 Ciphers to Use"
msgstr "Dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu SSLf3 i'w Defnyddio"

#: crypto.cpp:305
msgid ""
"Select the ciphers you wish to enable when using the SSL v3 protocol. The "
"actual protocol used will be negotiated with the server at connection time."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu yr hoffech eu galluogi pan yn defnyddio'r "
"protocol SSL f3. Trafodir y protocol i'w ddefnyddio ei hun â'r gweinydd ar "
"adeg cysylltu."

#: crypto.cpp:319
msgid "Cipher Wizard"
msgstr "Dewin Cêl-ysgrifennu"

#: crypto.cpp:322
msgid ""
"<qt>Use these preconfigurations to more easily configure the SSL encryption "
"settings. You can choose among the following modes: <ul>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Defnyddiwch y rhagffurfweddiadau yma i ffurfweddu'r gosodiadau amgriptio "
"SSL. Gallwch ddewis rhwng y moddau canlynol:<ul>"

#: crypto.cpp:325
msgid "Most Compatible"
msgstr "Mwyaf Cyfaddas"

#: crypto.cpp:326
msgid ""
"<li><b>Most Compatible:</b> Select the settings found to be most "
"compatible.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>Mwyaf Cyfaddas:</b> Dewiswch y gosodiadau a ganfuwyd i fod fwyaf "
"cyfaddas.</li>"

#: crypto.cpp:327
msgid "US Ciphers Only"
msgstr "Cêl-ysgrifennu yr UDau yn Unig"

#: crypto.cpp:328
msgid ""
"<li><b>US Ciphers Only:</b> Select only the US strong (&gt;= 128 bit) "
"encryption ciphers.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>Cêl-ysgrifennu yr UDau yn Unig:</b> Dewis dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu "
"cryf (&gt;= 128 did) yr UDau yn unig.</li>"

#: crypto.cpp:329
msgid "Export Ciphers Only"
msgstr "Cêl-ysgrifennu Allforedig yn Unig"

#: crypto.cpp:330
msgid ""
"<li><b>Export Ciphers Only:</b> Select only the weak ciphers (&lt;= 56 "
"bit).</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li><b>Cêl-ysgrifennu Allforedig yn Unig:</b>"
" Dewis dulliau cêl-ysgrifennu gwan (&lt;= 56 did) yn unig.</li>"

#: crypto.cpp:331
msgid "Enable All"
msgstr "Galluogi Popeth"

#: crypto.cpp:332
msgid "<li><b>Enable All:</b> Select all SSL ciphers and methods.</li></ul>"
msgstr "<li><b>Galluogi Popeth:</b> Dewis pob dull cêl-ysgrifennu SSL.</li></ul>"

#: crypto.cpp:343
msgid "Warn on &entering SSL mode"
msgstr "Rhybuddio ar &gychwyn modd SSL"

#: crypto.cpp:346
msgid "If selected, you will be notified when entering an SSL enabled site"
msgstr "Os yn ddewisiedig, cewch eich hysbysu pan yn mynd i safle SSL-alluog"

#: crypto.cpp:350
msgid "Warn on &leaving SSL mode"
msgstr "Rhybuddio ar &adael modd SSL"

#: crypto.cpp:353
msgid "If selected, you will be notified when leaving an SSL based site."
msgstr ""
"Os yn ddewisiedig, cewch eich hysbysu pan yn gadael safle sy'n seiliedig ar "
"SSL."

#: crypto.cpp:357
msgid "Warn on sending &unencrypted data"
msgstr "Rhybuddio ar anfon data &heb ei gelu"

#: crypto.cpp:360
msgid ""
"If selected, you will be notified before sending unencrypted data via a web "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Os yn ddewisiedig, cewch eich hysbysu cyn anfon data heb ei gelu drwy borydd "
"gwê."

#: crypto.cpp:365
msgid "Warn on &mixed SSL/non-SSL pages"
msgstr "Rhybuddio ar dudalennau &cymysg SSL/di-SSL"

#: crypto.cpp:368
msgid ""
"If selected, you will be notified if you view a page that has both encrypted "
"and non-encrypted parts."
msgstr ""
"Os yn ddewisiedig, cewch eich hysbysu os ydych yn gwylio tudalen sydd a "
"rhannau mewn cêl-ysgrifen a rhannau heb eu celu."

#: crypto.cpp:381
msgid "Path to OpenSSL Shared Libraries"
msgstr "Llwybr i Raglengelloedd Cyfrannol OpenSSL"

#: crypto.cpp:385
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Profi"

#: crypto.cpp:395
msgid "Use EGD"
msgstr "Defnyddio EGD"

#: crypto.cpp:397
msgid "Use entropy file"
msgstr "Defnydio ffeil entropi"

#: crypto.cpp:405 crypto.cpp:2286
msgid "Path to EGD:"
msgstr "Llwybr i EGD:"

#: crypto.cpp:411
msgid ""
"If selected, OpenSSL will be asked to use the entropy gathering daemon (EGD) "
"for initializing the pseudo-random number generator."
msgstr ""
"Os yn ddewisiedig, gofynnir i OpenSSL ddefnyddio'r ellyll casglu entropi "
"(EGD) i ymgychwyn y cynhyrchydd rhifau ffug-hap."

#: crypto.cpp:414
msgid ""
"If selected, OpenSSL will be asked to use the given file as entropy for "
"initializing the pseudo-random number generator."
msgstr ""
"Os yn ddewisiedig, gofynnir i OpenSSL ddefnyddio'r ffeil penodol fel entropi "
"i ymgychwyn y cynhyrchydd rhifau ffug-hap."

#: crypto.cpp:417
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the socket created by the entropy gathering daemon (or the "
"entropy file) here."
msgstr ""
"Rhowch y llwbr i'r soced a grëwyd gan yr ellyll casglu entropi (neu'r ffeil "
"entropi) yma."

#: crypto.cpp:420
msgid "Click here to browse for the EGD socket file."
msgstr "Cliciwch yma i bori am y ffeil soced EGD."

#: crypto.cpp:437
